{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2022-07-13 16:01:00', 'title': 'CSX CORP. DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA., JULY 13, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A $0.10 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUGUST 31, 2022."}